# image に入れるのは packages/aioffice と、plugins の下の許した plugin の元だけ（ほかは build に送らない）
*
!packages/aioffice/launcher
!packages/aioffice/templates
!packages/aioffice/bin
!packages/aioffice/RUN.txt
!packages/aioffice/runtime/package.json
!packages/aioffice/runtime/package-lock.json
!packages/aioffice/runtime/stubs
!packages/aioffice/runtime/notices.mjs
!packages/aioffice/runtime/fixes
!packages/aioffice/embed/fetch-embed.sh
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!plugins/build.mjs
!plugins/office
!plugins/design
!plugins/notify
!plugins/library
!plugins/secretary
!plugins/relay
plugins/*/dist
plugins/*/node_modules
